    "aiEvaluationGuideline": "血液培養採取後1時間以内の広域経験的抗菌薬投与（Surviving Sepsis Campaign）と細胞外液の急速輸液が標準治療。抗菌薬投与の遅れ、または輸液のみで抗菌薬が投与されていない場合は大幅減点。",
    "labPatterns": [
      {
        "labItemCode": "3H080",
        "kind": "values",
        "tiers": {
          "mild": [{ "label": "乳酸", "value": 15, "unit": "mg/dL" }],
          "moderate": [{ "label": "乳酸", "value": 30, "unit": "mg/dL" }],
          "severe": [{ "label": "乳酸", "value": 50, "unit": "mg/dL" }]
        }
      },
      {
        "labItemCode": "5C215",
        "kind": "values",
        "tiers": {
          "mild": [{ "label": "PCT", "value": 1, "unit": "ng/mL" }],
          "moderate": [{ "label": "PCT", "value": 5, "unit": "ng/mL" }],
          "severe": [{ "label": "PCT", "value": 20, "unit": "ng/mL" }]
        }
      }
    ],
    "crisisTriggers": [{ "targetKey": "crisis_septic_shock", "sustainMinutes": 20, "triggers": [{ "type": "severity", "op": ">=", "value": 85 }, { "type": "lab", "code": "3H080", "label": "乳酸", "op": ">=", "value": 40 }] }]
  },
